1
00:00:00,312 --> 00:00:02,562
(Leonard:)It'll look so nice
next to the ones he's got...

2
00:00:02,731 --> 00:00:05,271
(Leonard:)...from Leonard Nimoy,
Carl Sagan and Stan Lee.

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:09,820
(Sheldon:)Leonard, do you recall when I said
that I was going...

4
00:00:09,988 --> 00:00:13,078
...to revolutionize understanding
of the Higgs boson particle...

5
00:00:13,241 --> 00:00:16,791
...and you said, "Sheldon, it's 2 a.m.
Get out of my bedroom"?

6
00:00:17,746 --> 00:00:19,666
Like it was 10 hours ago.
What about it?

7
00:00:19,831 --> 00:00:21,411
Well, I believe l've done it.

8
00:00:21,583 --> 00:00:23,713
I'm only saying "believe"
to sound modest...

9
00:00:23,877 --> 00:00:26,127
(Sheldon:)...because, sweet Sam Houston,
l did it.

10
00:00:26,296 --> 00:00:28,296
- Really?
- That's incredible. Oh, here.

11
00:00:28,465 --> 00:00:30,845
(Raj:)- Break out the math.
- Oh, okay. Let me see this.

12
00:00:31,009 --> 00:00:35,679
(Sheldon:)All right, so this particle here
is the boson moving forward in time.

13
00:00:35,847 --> 00:00:37,597
(Sheldon:)Now, I was thinking...

14
00:00:37,766 --> 00:00:41,226
(Sheldon:)Howard, you go ahead and eat.
This isn't gonna make any sense to you.

15
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:45,690
(Howard:)Sheldon, I have a working understanding
of physics.

16
00:00:45,857 --> 00:00:48,487
(Sheldon:)Yeah, good for you.
And don't stop working on it.

17
00:00:50,028 --> 00:00:51,488
(Raj:)You still going to tell him...

18
00:00:51,655 --> 00:00:53,575
(Raj:)- ...about you-know-who?
- Yep.

19
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:58,040
- Still gonna introduce him?
- Not on your life.

